# Service tickets (#35). Reading: every role (customer only its own tickets).
# Create: Admin/Operator/Technician/Customer; triage and transitions: Admin/Operator; comments: Admin/Operator/Technician.
# Port matches launchSettings.json (http profile).
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080
@token = paste-access-token-here
@ticketId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@attachmentId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Report a fault with a photo (state New)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "installationId": "0199f0a0-0000-7000-8000-000000000001",
  "title": "Invertor hlási chybu",
  "description": "Od rána FVE nevyrába, na invertore svieti červená LED.",
  "priority": "High",
  "attachments": [
    { "fileName": "porucha.jpg", "contentType": "image/jpeg", "contentBase64": "/9j/4AAQSkZJRg==" }
  ]
}

### List: new high-priority tickets reported by customers, newest first
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets?state=New&priority=High&origin=CustomerReport&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List sorted by priority (High first)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets?sortBy=priority&sortDir=desc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Triage: set priority (New to Triaged)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}/triage
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "priority": "High", "note": "Výpadok celej výroby" }

### Transition (Triaged to RemoteDiagnosis; later Resolved, Closed)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}/transition
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "state": "RemoteDiagnosis", "note": "Kontrola logov invertora na diaľku" }

### History of state changes
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}/history
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Add a public comment
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "body": "Ozveme sa do 24 hodín.", "isPublic": true }

### Comments (a customer sees only public ones)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Download an attachment
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}/attachments/{{attachmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
